{"body":"### Clone classifier hides real SSH failures
**Medium Severity**
`cloneFailureMessage` treats any stderr containing `correct access rights` or `permission denied` as a missing repository. Git appends that footer to most SSH transport failures, and `permission denied` also appears when the destination cannot be created, so host-key, connection, and local write errors collapse to the same not-found line and drop the real cause.
